00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.030
Isn't that a bit depressing?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.590
But...

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:11.180
Jeez... I wish someone could just put an end to this rain right now.

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:13.790
