00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.170
Staaaare...

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:19.900
Oh yeah...

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:28.980
Then, sun above the clouds, jimejime- iyaiya-, show us your power!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:51.460
I just don't care about this anymore.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:56.600
Uma-san, I have to clean your undergarments as well,

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:02.460
So if you're just going to sit there... -it there, p-p-lease help me hang these up.

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.120
What's wrong?

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.120
The two-wo of you?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.520
Ai-chan, something's weird with you.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:10.520
Hm?

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.020
Hasn't there been something a little bit strange with they way you've been talking lately?

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:20.530
Is that so? Strange? S-s-s-s-s-s-trange?

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.300
Eh?

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.580
Are you okay? Are you not feeling well?

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.330
Well,

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:33.360
I have been feeling like something in my body body isn't working right.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:35.740
