00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.190
It's you! You did this!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.640
I did it! It was me who did it!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.770
But don't blame me!

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.620
What the heck are you trying to say by that?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.130
What should we do?

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.570
What can we do?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.940
What should we do...

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.850
Well we should at least clean out all that mold...

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.950
