00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.970
Whee! Feels so good!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:14.600
INDUSTRIAL STRENGTH MOLD ELIMINATION SPRAY

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:42.840
Jeez... She's filled with the stuff top to bottom.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.680
What should we do?

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.390
What do you think we should do?

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:52.390
