00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.710
Oh yeah!

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:41.440
It's reaching now!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:44.380
It's all coming off!

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.020
It's like a commercial!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.370
There aren't any commercials this good!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.510
Oh yeah!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.890
Of course!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.590
If we left them like this, they'll definitely rust.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:24.700
Yeah, they will!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.400
So we have to dry them!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.150
We have to dry them!

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:45.240
Okay, this is the last piece.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.610
How are you feeling?

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.330
Uma-san, Pachira-san.

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:36.470
