00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:41.100
It's like I've been reborn!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.020
It's amazing! Thank you so much!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.220
Really, thank you so much!

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.830
To pay you back, I'll once again roll up my sleeves and get to making some food!

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.450
I'm so glad that worked out!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.250
Looks like things worked out in the end!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.230
