00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:40.260
Eh, I'll put it here.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.180
Liru-san, please wait a little longer for dinner!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.580
I'm making a feast tonight!

